---
{% set treatmentLabels = {
    "oncology": "Cancer Treatment / Oncology",
    "cardiology": "Cardiac Surgery / Cardiology",
    "orthopedics": "Orthopedics / Joint Replacement",
    "ophthalmology": "Eye Surgery / LASIK",
    "obgyn": "IVF / Fertility Treatment",
    "dental": "Dental Treatment",
    "neurosurgery": "Neurology / Neurosurgery",
    "plastic": "Plastic / Cosmetic Surgery"
} %}
<header class="cx-hero">
    <h1>What Procedures Cost in China</h1>
    <p>If you already know which procedure you need, start here. Each card shows the typical total cost in China, how that compares abroad, and the hospitals that perform it — with a direct path to a case review.</p>
    <span class="cx-cross">Still working out what you need? <a href="/conditions/">Browse conditions by diagnosis →</a></span>
</header>

<div class="cx-crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Procedures</div>

<main class="cx-shell">
    {% for group in procedureGroups %}
    <h2 class="cx-cat">{{ group.label }}</h2>
    <div class="cx-grid">
        {% for p in group.items %}
        {% set treat = treatmentLabels[p.category] or "Other" %}
        <div class="cx-card">
            <div class="cname">{{ p.name }}</div>
            <div class="cprice{% if not p.priceText %} case{% endif %}">{{ p.priceDisplay }}</div>
            {% if p.usNote %}<div class="cus">{{ p.usNote }}</div>{% endif %}
            <div class="cdesc">{{ p.description }}</div>
            {% if p.hospitalObjects | length %}
            <div class="chosp">
                <div class="chlabel">Representative hospitals</div>
                {% for h in p.hospitalObjects %}{% if loop.index <= 3 %}
                <div class="chrow">{{ h.name }} <span>· {{ h.city }}</span></div>
                {% endif %}{% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="cx-actions">
                <a class="cx-btn" href="/contact-new.html?treatment={{ treat | urlencode }}">Get Matched →</a>
                {% if p.href %}<a class="cx-det" href="{{ p.href }}">Full details →</a>{% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <p style="margin:32px auto 0;text-align:center;font-size:0.86rem;color:#8893a0;">Prices are reference ranges for the total procedure in China, including hospital stay where applicable. They are not quotes — the final cost comes from the hospital after your records are reviewed.</p>

    <div class="cx-cta">
        <h2>Not sure which hospital is right for your case?</h2>
        <p>Send us your diagnosis or the procedure you've been advised to have, plus any scans or reports you already have. We'll tell you which Grade 3A hospitals handle your case, what it realistically costs, and whether China is worth considering at all — free, and with no obligation to go further.</p>
        <a href="/contact-new.html?source=procedures">Start Free Case Review →</a>
    </div>
</main>
